    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d689">

                <pb facs="0811" n="719" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v01/pg719"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 862.85/576</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Shea</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-09-12T18:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 12, 1918, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received September 13, 7.30
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>After first official reception of diplomatic corps by Foreign Minister this
                    afternoon, had conference with him complying with Department’s instruction June
                        [<hi rendition="#italic">September</hi>] 9, 6 p.m. He said that Government
                    was seriously considering the acquisition of the German vessels not damaged
                    without delay and would then take up the question of utilizing the others, that
                    they were anxious to cooperate with United States in maintaining commerce. Would
                    inform me at once when plan had been worked out. …</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shea</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
